  "keyFeatures": [
    "Public-facing pages for animals, habitats, and services browsing",
    "Role-based back-office (admin, veterinarian, employee)",
    "Animal health reporting and feeding logs",
    "Habitat management and improvement suggestions",
    "Visitor testimonials with moderation workflow",
